{"id":"suelo","lemma":"suelo","pos":"noun","rank":611,"glosses":["dirt, earth, ground, soil","floor, ground"],"ipa":"/ˈswelo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"suelos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-suelo.wav","formAudio":{"suelos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-suelos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"El suelo está frío.","en":"The floor is cold.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448176"},{"text":"Tengo que fregar los suelos.","en":"I have to mop the floors.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728575"},{"text":"Suelo ir a pie.","en":"I usually go on foot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453369"},{"text":"Todos los suelos de su casa están hechos de madera.","en":"All the floors in her house are made of wood.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692307"},{"text":"Tom fregó el suelo.","en":"Tom mopped the floor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67082"}]}